	"system": {
		"description": "<p>At 16th level, on reaching 0 HP, the construct may use a reaction to self destruct. All creatures and objects within 15ft must make a Dexterity save or take 3d6 bludgeoning and 3d6 fire damage. Those that make a successful save take half damage. Self destructing causes one failed death saving throw.</p><p>Your construct cannot self destruct if an effect would put them at 1 HP when they reach 0 HP.</p>",
